      63.21,
      355.57,
      524.49,
      378.64
    ],
    "text": "CLOSURE OF RUNWAY AT BANDARANAIKE INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT FOR THE PURPOSE OFRESURFACING",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      392.89,
      539.9,
      445.96
    ],
    "text": "MEMBERS of the public are hereby informed that the Bandaranaike International Airport, Colombo will be closed foroperation of all flights from 0830 hrs (0300 UTC) to 1630 hrs (1100 UTC) every day during the period commencingfrom 06th January, 2017 to 06th April, 2017 (both days inclusive) for the purpose of carrying out of the runway resurfacingwork.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.800000190734863,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      462.85,
      539.92,
      487.96
    ],
    "text": "Accordingly the Bandaranaike International Airport, Colombo would be opened for operation of flights only outsidethe aforementioned period during 06th January, 2017 \u2013 06th April, 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      400.29,
      504.85,
      535.3,
      528.64
    ],
